# MASTER BLUEPRINT: VOID-OS CYBER-BOY PROJECT

The software supports two compute profiles: ESP32 firmware and Raspberry Pi 5 native Linux. Use one profile at a time; the Raspberry Pi 5 profile is recommended for the full Linux-portable build.

This document serves as the definitive hardware and software repository reference for the Pip-Boy OS development ecosystem.

---

## 1.  BILL OF MATERIALS (BOM)

### Main Compute & Display
* **1x** Raspberry Pi 5 (2GB or larger) with Raspberry Pi OS, or **1x** ESP32-WROOM-32E for the original firmware profile
* **1x** 2.8-inch TFT LCD Module with SPI Interface (ILI9341 Driver Chip, 240x320 resolution)
* **1x** Micro SD Card Slot Breakout Board (SPI compatible)

### Radio, Sensor & Navigation Modules
* **1x** CC1101 Sub-GHz RF Transceiver Module (433MHz/868MHz) with SMA Antenna connector
* **1x** PN532 NFC / RFID Reader/Writer Module
* **1x** NEO-6M GPS Module with Ceramic Patch Antenna
* **1x** 2.4GHz antenna when using the ESP32 profile; Raspberry Pi 5 uses its onboard wireless hardware
* **1x** Sub-GHz Antenna (Tuned to regional ISM band, 433MHz or 868MHz)

### Discrete Electronics, Inputs & Haptics
* **1x** PCF8574 I2C 8-Bit Digital I/O Expander Board
* **1x** 10k Ohm Linear Rotary Potentiometer
* **1x** EC11 Rotary Encoder with Integrated Push Switch
* **3x** Momentary Tactile Push Buttons (Select, Back, Aux)
* **1x** Single-Pole Dual-Throw (SPDT) Slide Switch (For Hardware Kill-Switch)
* **1x** 5V 940nm Infrared (IR) LED Array Board
* **1x** 3V-5V Coin-Type Haptic Vibration Disc Motor
* **2x** IRLZ44N N-Channel Logic-Level MOSFETs (To switch high-current IR and Motor loads)
* **2x** 10k Ohm Resistors (Pull-down resistors for MOSFET Gates)
* **1x** 1N4007 Flyback Diode (Protects circuit against haptic motor voltage spikes)

### Power Management Network
* **1x** 18650 Li-ion Battery Cell (3.7V nominal)
* **1x** 18650 Single-Cell Battery Holder
* **1x** TP4056 or IP5306 Lithium Battery Charger Module with USB-C Input
* **1x** MAX17043 I2C Lithium Battery Fuel Gauge Board
* **1x** MT3608 DC-DC Step-Up Boost Converter Module (Adjusted to supply stable 5V output)

